要混合不同的音频文件，您可以使用Java Sound API。该API提供了许多类和接口，可用于读取、写入、处理和播放音频文件。您可以使用AudioInputStream类来读取音频文件，并使用Mixer类来混合它们。以下是一个简单的示例代码，演示如何读取两个音频文件并将它们混合在一起：

```java
import javax.sound.sampled.*;

public class AudioMixer {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        AudioInputStream stream1 = AudioSystem.getAudioInputStream(AudioMixer.class.getResourceAsStream("file1.wav"));
        AudioInputStream stream2 = AudioSystem.getAudioInputStream(AudioMixer.class.getResourceAsStream("file2.wav"));

        AudioFormat format = stream1.getFormat();
        Mixer mixer = AudioSystem.getMixer(null);

        DataLine.Info info = new DataLine.Info(SourceDataLine.class, format);
        SourceDataLine line = (SourceDataLine) mixer.getLine(info);
        line.open(format);
        line.start();

        byte[] buffer = new byte[4096];
        int bytesRead = 0;

        while ((bytesRead = stream1.read(buffer)) != -1) {
            line.write(buffer, 0, bytesRead);
        }

        while ((bytesRead = stream2.read(buffer)) != -1) {
            line.write(buffer, 0, bytesRead);
        }

        line.drain();
        line.stop();
        line.close();
        stream1.close();
        stream2.close();
    }
}
```

